        </div>
        <div class="qc-feedback"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="q" data-qc='{"correct":2,"feedback":"correct. the pandemic exposed how unequal access to housing, healthcare, and remote work already was."}'>
        <p>The pandemic hit some groups of people harder. The text says one big reason was:</p>
