          <button>Donald Trump, with 306 electoral votes</button>
          <button>The election was a tie and was decided by Congress</button>
        </div>
        <div class="qc-feedback"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="q" data-qc='{"correct":1,"feedback":"yes. a mob of Trump supporters attacked the Capitol during the Electoral College certification."}'>
