        </div>
        <div class="qc-feedback"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="q" data-qc='{"correct":0,"feedback":"yes. inflation means prices go up across the board, so your money buys less than before."}'>
        <p>When economists talk about "inflation," what does it mean?</p>
        <div class="qc-opts">
          <button>Prices going up across the economy, so money buys less</button>
          <button>Balloons becoming a fashion trend</button>
          <button>The government printing extra money for fun</button>
        </div>
        <div class="qc-feedback"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="q" data-qc='{"correct":1,"feedback":"correct. Dobbs overturned Roe and returned abortion law to the states."}'>
