</section>

<!-- ============ CHAPTER 4 :: WAR + GLOBAL DISTRUST ============ -->
<section class="chapter" id="ch4" style="background: var(--paper-2);">
  <div class="ch-inner reveal">
    <span class="ch-tag purple">// CHAPTER FOUR</span>
    <div class="ch-num">04</div>
    <h1 class="ch-title">WAR, RIVALRY, AND THE WORLD ON EDGE</h1>
    <p class="ch-meme">when the news made you want to put your phone down</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">On February 24, 2022, Russia launched a full-scale invasion of <strong>Ukraine</strong>. That wasn't the start of the conflict. The fight had been going on in pieces since 2014, when Russia took Crimea. But February 2022 was the day Russia tried to topple the whole Ukrainian government.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="image-card">
      <img src="" data-img="ukraine_map" alt="A map showing the routes of the 2022 Russian invasion of Ukraine, with arrows pointing from Russia and Belarus into Ukrainian territory.">
      <div class="caption">// the invasion came from multiple directions at once. the red arrows show Russian forces moving into Ukraine. Ukraine pushed back hard and the war has continued for years.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="image-card">
      <img src="" data-img="ukraine_tanks" alt="Two Russian military tanks rolling down a wet road during the invasion of Ukraine.">
      <div class="caption">// Russian tanks on a Ukrainian highway, February 2022. for many young people this was the first time they saw a major European country get invaded on live video.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>The Ukraine war changed global politics. <span class="vocab" data-term="nato">NATO</span> got stronger as more countries joined or moved closer. Europe rushed to stop buying so much oil and gas from Russia. Military spending shot up. Food and energy prices wobbled around the world. Ukraine became a symbol of resistance for many countries. Russia told a very different story about why the war started. The full meaning of this war is still being written, because it isn't over.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>Then on <strong>October 7, 2023</strong>, Hamas-led Palestinian armed groups launched a surprise attack on Israel from the Gaza Strip. They fired thousands of rockets, broke through the perimeter fence, killed civilians and soldiers, and took hostages. Israel responded with a massive military campaign in Gaza that lasted for many months.</p>

      <p>The war in Gaza has been one of the heaviest stories of the decade. Civilians have suffered terribly. The <span class="vocab" data-term="humanitarian">humanitarian</span> conditions in Gaza became severe. The hostage crisis became central. Arguments about the war flared everywhere :: on campuses, in governments, online. People disagree strongly about who is to blame and what should happen next. The basic facts most observers agree on are: many civilians have died, many people have been displaced, the hostage situation has been a tragedy, and the war made existing global arguments about security, occupation, terrorism, antisemitism, Islamophobia, and international law even sharper.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="image-card">
      <div class="sensitive-wrap" data-sensitive>
        <div class="sensitive-cover">
          <span class="warning">⚠ INTENSE IMAGE</span>
          <div>Smoke and fire rise from buildings during the war in Gaza.</div>
          <small>tap anywhere to reveal</small>
        </div>
        <img src="" data-img="gaza_smoke" alt="Smoke rising from buildings in Gaza City during an airstrike.">
      </div>
      <div class="caption">// Gaza City. for many months, scenes like this were the daily reality for people living there.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="image-card">
      <div class="sensitive-wrap" data-sensitive>
        <div class="sensitive-cover">
          <span class="warning">⚠ INTENSE IMAGE</span>
          <div>An Israeli civilian runs from danger near her home during the October 7 attack.</div>
          <small>tap anywhere to reveal</small>
        </div>
        <img src="" data-img="israel_running" alt="A woman runs across open ground in southern Israel with smoke rising in the distance during the October 7, 2023 attack.">
      </div>
